## Approach

Split the monolithic `extract_symbol_attrs()` into a generic cross-language helper and language-specific extraction via the `FcaAttributeSource` trait. Language-specific implementations read from the `language_attrs` JSON column (populated at parse time by sutra/34) instead of string-matching signatures. A dispatch function looks up each file's adapter via the registry, checks for `FcaAttributeSource` capability, and falls back to cross-language-only extraction when absent (graceful degradation for Dart, etc.).

